## Verification Commands

### Per Scope Contract
```bash
# SC1: Migration Infrastructure
npm run typegen  # Verify types
node scripts/migrations/addReservedStock.mjs --dry-run  # Test dry-run

# SC2: Data Migration
node scripts/migrations/verifyReservedStock.mjs --count  # Pre-migration
node scripts/migrations/addReservedStock.mjs  # Execute
node scripts/migrations/verifyReservedStock.mjs  # Post-migration

# SC3: Code Cleanup
npx vitest run tests/integration/checkout/  # Checkout tests
npx playwright test tests/e2e/checkout/  # End-to-end tests
```

### Final Sprint Verification
```bash
# Build gate (ONLY after sprint completion)
npm run build

# Full test suite
npx vitest run
npx playwright test

# Data integrity check
node scripts/migrations/verifyReservedStock.mjs --full
```

